<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport Bangalore to Pune | Vehicle Shifting Charges
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are car transport charges calculated for a Bangalore to Pune move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are based on vehicle size, weight, distance (approximately 956 km), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling like hydraulic ramp loading. Shree Ashirwad also factors in real‑time traffic, tolls, and optional services such as door‑to‑door delivery, ensuring transparent pricing that aligns with &quot;packers and movers charges from bangalore to pune&quot;.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to shift my car from Bangalore to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original RC book, valid insurance, a signed loading order, a government‑issued e‑Way bill, and a copy of your ID proof. For inter‑state moves, a No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) from the originating RTO may be required. Shree Ashirwad assists in preparing and filing all paperwork to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my vehicle insured during the transit between Bangalore and Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. This policy protects against loss, theft, or damage throughout the journey, giving you peace of mind while your car travels with the &quot;packers and movers bangalore to pune&quot; service.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp gently lowers the vehicle onto a low‑bed carrier, eliminating manual lifting. Trained operators align the car’s wheels with the ramp, engage the 4‑wheel lock, and secure it with ratchet lashings. This method reduces stress on the chassis and ensures a smooth, damage‑free loading experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety checks are performed before the vehicle leaves Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A joint inspection is conducted by the customer and the mover. The team documents the car’s exterior condition with photos, checks tire pressure, verifies fluid levels, and records any existing scratches. This checklist is signed by both parties, establishing a clear baseline for post‑delivery verification.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car’s movement in real time during the Bangalore‑to‑Pune transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All Shree Ashirwad trucks are equipped with satellite GPS units that provide live location updates via a secure portal. Customers receive real‑time alerts on departure, transit milestones, and estimated arrival, ensuring full visibility of the &quot;packers and movers bangalore to pune&quot; journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What additional services are available for fragile items shipped with my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, custom wooden crates, and edge padding for delicate cargo such as glassware, temple idols, or electronics. These services are ideal for customers using the &quot;house old items parcel service bangalore to pune&quot; alongside vehicle transport.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
